{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Descendant of Night</i></strong> is a love letter to the 00s era of survival horror. Step into the shoes of <strong>Blake Cage</strong>, a charismatic and sharp-tongued operative of <strong>Vector Six</strong>\u00a0- humanity\u2019s last hope against the darkness. Unravel a gripping, lore-rich mystery where the lines blur between ancient immortals, bloodthirsty vampires, and the desperate struggle of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the PS2/GCube era of survival horror classics, <strong><i>Descendant of Night</i></strong> delivers a tense, atmospheric experience that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jade Silva</strong>, Blake\u2019s fast-talking, sharp-witted Brazilian partner, features as an unlockable solo playable character. <br><br> A post-release update will introduce Jade as Player 2 in local co-op, with her own charisma and chemistry to the fight against the undead - matching Blake beat for beat.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790730?t=1768685176","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790730/445b98d59582f698a5a87ade4fe4b0d7d096d9dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768685176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790730/5e73c00f88285c1d3edc4ed67bf624c56ef4c94f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768685176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790730/5e73c00f88285c1d3edc4ed67bf624c56ef4c94f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768685176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Contains moderate violence against non-human enemies depicted in a fantastical way. \r\n\r\nSome enemies are represented with no clothing, bearing breasts and buttocks. No frontal nudity.\r\n\r\nMind control symbolism designed to instigate fear as part of the wider narrative.\r\n\r\nSome mild curse-words ."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Descendant of Night</i></strong> is a love letter to the 00s era of survival horror. Step into the shoes of <strong>Blake Cage</strong>, a charismatic and sharp-tongued operative of <strong>Vector Six</strong>\u00a0- humanity\u2019s last hope against the darkness. Unravel a gripping, lore-rich mystery where the lines blur between ancient immortals, bloodthirsty vampires, and the desperate struggle of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the PS2/GCube era of survival horror classics, <strong><i>Descendant of Night</i></strong> delivers a tense, atmospheric experience that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jade Silva</strong>, Blake\u2019s fast-talking, sharp-witted Brazilian partner, features as an unlockable solo playable character. <br><br> A post-release update will introduce Jade as Player 2 in local co-op, with her own charisma and chemistry to the fight against the undead - matching Blake beat for beat.</p>","developers":["Project Gaiden"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790730/0c38dd083abd40618cfd2dfcaa55e5be15219d50/header.jpg?t=1768685176","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights, title, and interest in and to the video game Descendant of Night, including but not limited to its story, characters, names, dialogue, artwork, gameplay systems, music, an